# Production backend URL (Node.js + Socket.io).
# InfinityFree is static-only - it CANNOT run Node.js or mod_proxy, so the
# browser connects DIRECTLY to this URL.
#
# CORS: the server echoes exact origins listed in its CLIENT_URL env var
# (never '*' - browsers reject a wildcard for credentialed requests), so
# Render's CLIENT_URL MUST include this app's origin, e.g.:
#   CLIENT_URL=https://dmatest.rf.gd
#
# The URL must be HTTPS (WebRTC + Socket.io require a secure context in prod).
VITE_SERVER_URL=https://webinar-api-fine.onrender.com